   'A stunning "Or HaZahav" menorah with gently curved gold arms on an elegant clear crystal base. A unique, modern design that elevates any home for the Festival of Lights. Gift included: a Perspex card with the candle-lighting blessing. A quality piece combining the beauty of the mitzvah with striking interior design.',
