   'A wire menorah in a classic semicircular model, black with shiny gold-tone cups that create an elegant contrast. The arched arms give a delicate, festive look, perfect for any Jewish home. A stable base that elevates any corner: a stunning addition that will light up the Festival of Lights with joy.',
