   'A stunning wire menorah in a classic design, silver-plated and shiny, with elegant semicircular arcs and a stable base. The nine arms stand in a harmonious row around a striped column, giving the home warm, dignified holiday light. A winning combination of strength and design quality for any Jewish home.',
