   'A reversible, elegant menorah in a sparkling rose gold finish, with shaped legs and a splendid base decorated with delicate lace patterns set with sparkling stones. The eight shiny cups and the luxurious shamash elevate any home. A winning combination of splendour, quality and tradition for an especially festive Hanukkah.',
