   'An elegant menorah in a stunning combination of gold and silver, with a base decorated with regal lace and splendid, elegant legs. The oil cups in a bright gold finish add a festive glow to any home. A reversible design that is easy to store, perfect for lighting and decorating for the Festival of Lights in true splendour.',
